  m_text: 'STAFF CREDITS


    GAME DESIGN CONCEPT







    ORIGINAL CONCEPT



    PROJECT
    MANAGER



    LEAD DESIGNER



    LEAD SYSTEM DESIGNER



    TECHNICAL DIRECTOR




    PROGRAMMING


    LEAD
    PROGRAMMER



    PROGRAMMERS




    TASK MANAGER




    ART


    LEAD ARTIST



    ART
    DIRECTOR



    CONCEPT ARTIST


    ARTISTS




    LEAD UI/UX DESIGN



    UI
    ARTISTS



    LEAD ANIMATOR



    CHARACTER ANIMATION




    CREATURE ANIMATION



    CAMERA
    ARTIST



    ART CONSULTANT



    SCRUM MASTER



    SOUND


    AUDIO DIRECTOR



    COMPOSER



    SFX
    ARTIST



    SOUND DESIGN



    AUDIO PROGRAMMER



    AUDIO ENGINEER



    STOCK
    SOUND PROVIDED BY freesound_community



    WRITING


    LEAD WRITER


    WRITERS




    MARKETING
    DIRECTOR



    QA LEAD




    SONGS










    SPECIAL THANKS





    THE
    RAT CAT



    RAT CATS



    RAT CAT DIRECTOR















    THANK YOU'
